{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 90, "line_no": 2, "text": "摩借用汉字记录和书写经文的情况也逐渐多起来。", "bbox_px": {"x": 68, "y": 270, "w": 888, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "摩借用汉字记录和书写经文的情况也逐渐多起来。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 68, "y": 270, "w": 888, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 90, "line_no": 3, "text": "其借用的方式，开始时可能只借用与布依语词发音相同或相近似的汉字来记音，以", "bbox_px": {"x": 153, "y": 334, "w": 1467, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "其借用的方式，开始时可能只借用与布依语词发音相同或相近似的汉字来记音，以", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 153, "y": 334, "w": 1467, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 90, "line_no": 4, "text": "后，在掌握了汉字结构规律后，就发展到利用汉字偏旁部首，按“六书”造字法创造新的文", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 394, "w": 1548, "h": 61}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "后，在掌握了汉字结构规律后，就发展到利用汉字偏旁部首，按“六书”造字法创造新的文", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 394, "w": 1548, "h": 61}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 90, "line_no": 5, "text": "字符号，并约定俗成地创造部分符号。", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 467, "w": 663, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "字符号，并约定俗成地创造部分符号。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 467, "w": 663, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 90, "line_no": 6, "text": "由于这种文字的主体是汉字，所以汉字的发展变化对它也发生着影响。例如中华人", "bbox_px": {"x": 157, "y": 527, "w": 1463, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "由于这种文字的主体是汉字，所以汉字的发展变化对它也发生着影响。例如中华人", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 157, "y": 527, "w": 1463, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 90, "line_no": 7, "text": "民共和国成立后，一些布摩再抄写经文时使用简化汉字而不再使用或只部分使用繁体", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 591, "w": 1544, "h": 61}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "民共和国成立后，一些布摩再抄写经文时使用简化汉字而不再使用或只部分使用繁体", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 591, "w": 1544, "h": 61}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 90, "line_no": 8, "text": "字。", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 660, "w": 68, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "字。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 660, "w": 68, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 90, "line_no": 9, "text": "（二）文字构成及其特点", "bbox_px": {"x": 157, "y": 724, "w": 434, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（二）文字构成及其特点", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 157, "y": 724, "w": 434, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 90, "line_no": 10, "text": "这类文字，其构成与汉字基本上相同。形声字占相当比重。", "bbox_px": {"x": 157, "y": 789, "w": 1029, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "这类文字，其构成与汉字基本上相同。形声字占相当比重。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 157, "y": 789, "w": 1029, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 90, "line_no": 11, "text": "布依族古文字的特点，表现在使用和文字构成两个方面。", "bbox_px": {"x": 157, "y": 853, "w": 989, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族古文字的特点，表现在使用和文字构成两个方面。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 157, "y": 853, "w": 989, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 90, "line_no": 12, "text": "使用方面，不统一可说是最突出的特点。同一个音，不同地区甚至不同的人用来记", "bbox_px": {"x": 157, "y": 917, "w": 1467, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "使用方面，不统一可说是最突出的特点。同一个音，不同地区甚至不同的人用来记", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 157, "y": 917, "w": 1467, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 90, "line_no": 13, "text": "录和表示的汉字都可能不同。例如表示布依语“来”（ma'）这个词的汉字，有用“妈”的，", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 975, "w": 1548, "h": 75}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "录和表示的汉字都可能不同。例如表示布依语“来”（ma'）这个词的汉字，有用“妈”的，", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 975, "w": 1548, "h": 75}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 90, "line_no": 14, "text": "也有用“骂”的；表示“吃”（kun'）这个词的汉字，有的用“根“或“庚”，有的用“更”，也有", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1036, "w": 1540, "h": 71}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "也有用“骂”的；表示“吃”（kun'）这个词的汉字，有的用“根“或“庚”，有的用“更”，也有", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1036, "w": 1540, "h": 71}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 90, "line_no": 15, "text": "的用“艮”，等等。", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1114, "w": 298, "h": 54}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "的用“艮”，等等。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1114, "w": 298, "h": 54}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 90, "line_no": 16, "text": "各地在借用汉字的同时，都自己新创部分新字。而各地新创的字以及新创字在各地", "bbox_px": {"x": 161, "y": 1175, "w": 1463, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "各地在借用汉字的同时，都自己新创部分新字。而各地新创的字以及新创字在各地", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 161, "y": 1175, "w": 1463, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 90, "line_no": 17, "text": "所占比重也是不同的。大致的情况是：贵州南部与广西毗邻的册亨、望谟、罗甸和荔波等", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1239, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "所占比重也是不同的。大致的情况是：贵州南部与广西毗邻的册亨、望谟、罗甸和荔波等", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1239, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 90, "line_no": 18, "text": "地，自创文字的比重略大些，其余地区则以借用汉字为主，兼创部分新文字和抽象符号。", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1304, "w": 1520, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "地，自创文字的比重略大些，其余地区则以借用汉字为主，兼创部分新文字和抽象符号。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1304, "w": 1520, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
